## Troubleshooting Common Issues

### Database Connection Fails
- Verify MDS endpoint and credentials
- Check SSL/TLS settings
- Ensure N8N can reach Oracle Cloud (firewall/security groups)

### AI Requests Fail
- Verify OpenAI API key and credits
- Check rate limits
- Review prompt length and format

### Scraping Issues
- Oracle may block requests - add User-Agent headers
- Implement random delays between requests
- Check if Oracle blog structure changed

### Memory Issues
- Limit content length in processing nodes
- Process fewer posts per run
- Add cleanup for large data objects

